{"id":114,"chapter_id":0,"scene_id":3,"steps":[{"step":2,"content":"每当她们释放那异常的力量，你掌心的枷锁就会跳动，像是有某种疯狂的力量在灼烧。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"视野逐渐模糊，你的意识再次回到了那个梦境——\n梦境中的“你”在对谁轻语……","style":3,"background":54,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"过来，<color=#fb9259>赫卡蒂</color>，这不是结束。","voice":["vo_cgplot_108003","vo_cgplot_108003f"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":2,"background":54,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"我们说好了……","voice":["vo_cgplot_108004","vo_cgplot_108004f"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":2,"background":54,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"短暂的沉默后，有谁向你伸出了手，那个人带着强烈的情感，想要向你靠近。","style":3,"background":55,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"你尝试抓住那只手，但破碎的梦境却将你渐渐推离……","style":3,"background":55,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"S-019","content":"结束了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_108006"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"S-019","content":"局长，你没受伤吧？","voice":["vo_cgplot_108007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"你摇摇头，意识却还有些混沌。刚刚那些难辨真假的画面，会是你失去的记忆吗？","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"选项","content":"我们以前见过面吗？","options":["我们以前见过面吗？"],"jump":[13],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"S-019","content":"没有。","voice":["vo_cgplot_108010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"选项","content":"可我知道你的名字","options":["可我知道你的名字"],"jump":[15],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"不是S-019……你的名字是<color=#fb9259>赫卡蒂</color>。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"S-019","content":"……我已经不需要这个名字了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_108013"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"S-019","content":"但如果这是局长的希望，那就这么叫我吧。","voice":["vo_cgplot_108014"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"该走了，夜莺副官在等你。","voice":["vo_cgplot_108015"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1}]}